stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> staging: validated input and admitted upload
    staging --> staging: verified file acknowledgement / resumable failure
    staging --> finalizing: every case range acknowledged
    finalizing --> finalizing: verify membership and publish bounded metadata
    finalizing --> finalized: live generation / atomic catalog commit
    staging --> aborted: explicit abort revokes generation
    finalizing --> aborted: explicit abort revokes generation
    staging --> expired: inactivity expiry revokes generation
    finalizing --> expired: inactivity expiry revokes generation
    aborted --> cleanup: former lease plus request quarantine elapsed
    expired --> cleanup: former lease plus request quarantine elapsed
    cleanup --> cleanup: bounded exact-key page / retry uncertain deletion
    cleanup --> cleaned: all owned keys reconciled
    finalized --> [*]: shared immutable reference
    cleaned --> [*]: retained SQL tombstone
